{title: Nain Na Jodi}
{artist: Ayushman Khurana Neha Kakkar Badhaai Ho}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]Tere bin saans na le [Bm]mere din [A]raat,        [D] (Ho ho.. [G]sajna..)
[D]Khali khali lagte he [Bm]laqirowale haat,        [D] (Ho ho.. [G]sajna..)
[D]Tere bin saans na le [Bm]mere din [A]raat,        [D]Khali khali lagte he [Bm]laqirowale [A]haat
[A]Saath mere [D]chalte [Bm]chalte.. [A]haaye,        [D]Saath mere chalte chalte [Bm]rastena [A]modi
Nain na jodi kitte [A]nain na [D]jodi,        [D]Nain na jodi kitte [A]nain na [D]jodi
Tennu [D]vaasta Khuda da.. [A]haaye..        Tennu [D]vaasta Khuda da mera [G]dil na todi
[D]Birah de rang jisnu lag jaawan,        [D]Akhiyan vichon barse saawan
[Bm]Langh ke jis di tutt gayi yaari,        [A]Raah takde reh gaye saajan
[D]Jis nu ishq de gham lagde [Bm]ne [A]haaye,        [D]Jis nu ishq de gham lagde
Reh [Bm]jandi jindadi [A]thodi [D],        Nain na jodeen kitte [A]nain [D]na jodi
Nain [D]na jodeen kitte [A]nain [D]na jodi,        Haaye..
Nain na jodeen kitte [A]nain [D]na jodi,        Nain na [D]jodeen kitte [A]nain [D]na jodi
